#. type: Content of: <div><dl><dd><h2>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/news.html:24 xhtml/upstream/lfs/news.html:102
msgid "Important Note"
msgstr "Observação Importante"

#. type: Content of: <div><dl><dd><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/news.html:26
msgid ""
"Over the last six months there has been a huge number (195 and counting) of "
"security updates to packages in both LFS and BLFS.  To review the security "
"advisories see the <a href=\"https://rivendell.linuxfromscratch.org/"
"advisories/index.php\"> LFS Security Advisories</a>."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><dl><dd><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/lfs/news.html:32 xhtml/upstream/lfs/news.html:104
msgid ""
"We are no longer directly updating the System V version of LFS.  This may "
"change in the future, but for now the most recent version of System V LFS "
"remains at 12.4."
msgstr ""
"Nós não mais estamos atualizando diretamente a versão System V do LFS. Isso "
"possivelmente mude no futuro, porém, por enquanto, a versão mais recente do "
"System V LFS permanece em 12.4."

